# Playwright MCP leaves snapshots and screenshots where it is run from.
.playwright-mcp/

# Build intermediates for the app icon. Only Resources/Chute.icns and site/src/app/favicon.ico
# are committed — both are regenerated from Scripts/make-icon.swift, which writes these two
# directories on the way there.
Resources/Chute.iconset/
Resources/icon-review/

# handoff-journal plugin — write-once journal, generated head
handoff/journal/**/*.tmp-*
handoff/NEXT.md.tmp-*
.claude/.cache/

# The handoff head is a DERIVED VIEW of handoff/journal/**, not a source of
# truth, and committing it is what made concurrent sessions collide: each
# session appends a different journal entry, so each regenerates a different
# aggregate over the same lines. The journal files themselves have never
# conflicted once - every one is a new, uniquely-named file. Untracked
# 2026-09-08 so a conflict has nothing left to collide with. The SessionStart
# hook injects the head into every session, and `handoff-head` rebuilds the
# file on demand, deterministically, from that same journal.
handoff/NEXT.md

# The founder's own unpublished GTM work — launch posts, the LinkedIn series, the content
# calendar, positioning. His writing, not the product's documentation. Never part of the public
# repo. The three files that WERE load-bearing for public things now live in docs/:
# FACT-SHEET.md (the claims gate reads it), BUILDING-WITH-AGENTS.md (it IS the
# /building-with-agents page) and APPLE-AND-DISTRIBUTION.md (the README links it).
# site/scripts/check-claims.mjs SKIPS its three marketing gates loudly when this is absent.
marketing/
